   "detailed_description": "<h1>數位豪華版</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622380/extras/e90dcc3f95515753568130d9a3e6ca98.avif?t=1791488960\" width=780 height=438 /></span><br>本商品包含下列內容：[/p]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 艾爾登法環 黑夜君臨（遊戲本體）</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 見棄空洞者（追加下載內容）</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 艾爾登法環 黑夜君臨 數位美術書＆迷你原聲帶（應用程式）</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >下載內容《見棄空洞者》為《艾爾登法環 黑夜君臨》的追加下載內容，內容包含2位新角色與2位目標（頭目），以及全新的特異地形。敬請享受擴充遊戲本體的追加下載內容。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※購買後能立刻使用數位美術書＆迷你原聲帶（應用程式）。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※於2025年12月3日（三）前購買豪華版升級組合包與單獨發售的下載內容《見棄空洞者》也會獲得數位美術書＆迷你原聲帶（應用程式）。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※另有單獨發售的遊戲本體《艾爾登法環 黑夜君臨》數位標準版與下載內容《見棄空洞者》，請留意勿重複購買。</p></p><br><h1>關於此遊戲</h1>《艾爾登法環 黑夜君臨》（ELDEN RING NIGHTREIGN）為基於《艾爾登法環》（ELDEN RING）的世界觀，<br>重新構思遊戲的核心設計，帶給玩家全新體驗的衍生作品。<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622380/extras/0f44543bf46b9cb7f30b2a267fccb63b.poster.avif?t=1791488960\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622380/extras/0f44543bf46b9cb7f30b2a267fccb63b.webm?t=1791488960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622380/extras/0f44543bf46b9cb7f30b2a267fccb63b.mp4?t=1791488960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >並肩而戰</h2>與其他玩家合作，對抗逐步逼近的黑夜，以及潛藏其中的危險。<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622380/extras/9b0f1ec8eb6c9dd2a7e5e1c30819ac50.poster.avif?t=1791488960\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622380/extras/9b0f1ec8eb6c9dd2a7e5e1c30819ac50.webm?t=1791488960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622380/extras/9b0f1ec8eb6c9dd2a7e5e1c30819ac50.mp4?t=1791488960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >成為英雄</h2>可操作角色各個都有獨特的能力；透過團隊合作，能力的效果會相得益彰。<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622380/extras/3d48a07657a423c99eb6ebd25391ad37.poster.avif?t=1791488960\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622380/extras/3d48a07657a423c99eb6ebd25391ad37.webm?t=1791488960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622380/extras/3d48a07657a423c99eb6ebd25391ad37.mp4?t=1791488960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >挑戰黑夜</h2>每次出擊時的環境會有所變化──克服接連而來的威脅，打敗夜裡出現的強大頭目吧。",
   "about_the_game": "《艾爾登法環 黑夜君臨》（ELDEN RING NIGHTREIGN）為基於《艾爾登法環》（ELDEN RING）的世界觀，<br>重新構思遊戲的核心設計，帶給玩家全新體驗的衍生作品。<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622380/extras/0f44543bf46b9cb7f30b2a267fccb63b.poster.avif?t=1791488960\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622380/extras/0f44543bf46b9cb7f30b2a267fccb63b.webm?t=1791488960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622380/extras/0f44543bf46b9cb7f30b2a267fccb63b.mp4?t=1791488960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >並肩而戰</h2>與其他玩家合作，對抗逐步逼近的黑夜，以及潛藏其中的危險。<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622380/extras/9b0f1ec8eb6c9dd2a7e5e1c30819ac50.poster.avif?t=1791488960\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622380/extras/9b0f1ec8eb6c9dd2a7e5e1c30819ac50.webm?t=1791488960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622380/extras/9b0f1ec8eb6c9dd2a7e5e1c30819ac50.mp4?t=1791488960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >成為英雄</h2>可操作角色各個都有獨特的能力；透過團隊合作，能力的效果會相得益彰。<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622380/extras/3d48a07657a423c99eb6ebd25391ad37.poster.avif?t=1791488960\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622380/extras/3d48a07657a423c99eb6ebd25391ad37.webm?t=1791488960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622380/extras/3d48a07657a423c99eb6ebd25391ad37.mp4?t=1791488960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >挑戰黑夜</h2>每次出擊時的環境會有所變化──克服接連而來的威脅，打敗夜裡出現的強大頭目吧。",
